@base = http://localhost:4000/api

### list with pagination
GET {{base}}/products?limit=5&skip=0

### search + category filter
GET {{base}}/products?q=phone&category=smartphones

### one product
GET {{base}}/products/1

### create
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My product",
  "description": "Created from the lab",
  "price": 19.99,
  "thumbnail": "https://cdn.dummyjson.com/product-images/1/thumbnail.webp",
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "lab"
}

### invalid body -> 400
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "price": -5 }

### update
PATCH {{base}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 9.5 }

### delete
DELETE {{base}}/products/101

### not found -> 404
GET {{base}}/products/99999
### create a review
POST {{base}}/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "Yasmine", "rating": 5, "comment": "Great product" }

### list reviews
GET {{base}}/products/1/reviews

### invalid review -> 400
POST {{base}}/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "Y", "rating": 9, "comment": "" }

### review on unknown product -> 404
GET {{base}}/products/99999/reviews
